<title>UK: Leads exercise LUKoil convertible $30mln greenshoe.</title>
<headline>Leads exercise LUKoil convertible $30mln greenshoe.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-04-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>NatWest Securities, Banque</p>
<p>Paribas and SBC Warburg said on Wednesday they had exercised in full their option to purchase an additional $30 million LUKoil LKOH.RTS convertible bonds.</p>
<p>The $200 million bond was launched on April 14 and has been priced.</p>
<p>BORROWER   LUKOIL</p>
<p>AMT	  $200 MLN	COUPON     3.5 PCT   MATURITY   *</p>
<p>2002</p>
<p>TYPE    CONVERTIBLE	ISS PRICE  PAR	 IND PREM    24.7</p>
<p>PCT</p>
<p>NEG PLG    YES	     CRS DEFLT  YES	 LISTING     LONDON</p>
<p>NOTES   *CALLABLE FROM YEAR THREE AT ACCRETED VALUE</p>
<p>	  SUBJECT TO 140 PCT HURDLE. CONVERTIBLE INT LONDON-LISTED</p>
<p>GDRS</p>
<p>	  OF LUKOIL. REDEMPTION 130.323 TO GIVE YIELD TO MATURITY</p>
<p>OF 170</p>
<p>	  BASIS POINTS OVER U.S. TREASURY NOTES.</p>
<p>	 -- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7718</p>
</text>
